","e":"docs","d":"2022-05-17","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Tangney","x":"So we don't consider the direct-to-consumer at all on that, and actually, I don't even know off hand what percent of direct-to-consumer is digital.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/doximity-inc-docs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2022 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2022-05-17","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Jessica Tassan","x":"Do you have a sense of the split between direct to provider and direct-to-consumer?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/doximity-inc-docs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2022 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2022-05-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Tangney","x":"We tried to run a little correlation on this, and it's hard because they're also quiet about -- they don't want the word layoffs appearing anywhere any of the documentation that they put out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/doximity-inc-docs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2022 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2022-05-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anna Bryson","x":"We are pleased to increase our full year guidance by $6 million at the midpoint from our prior estimate of $450 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/doximity-inc-docs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2022 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2022-05-17","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Stephanie Davis","x":"I'm going to ask the same question that I think a lot of folks are going to ask in this Q&A, but your 1Q came in a bit lighter than our estimates, but you've also raised the full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/18/doximity-inc-docs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Cherny","x":"I keep thinking back to every data point we seemingly see about a government that is very hostile towards direct-to-consumer advertising and what that could mean for your ability to further gain share above and beyond what you're already doing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Allen Lutz","x":"I know the direct-to-consumer is under some pressure, but is that impacting or bleeding into the HCP market?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"David Roman","x":"But as we're starting to see companies in the medical device industry, for example, starting to focus a lot more on direct-to-consumer advertising and bridging more into the PCP channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Anna Bryson","x":"We believe the longer time on channel, more strategic spending cadence and AI optimization will provide higher returns for our clients and better predictability for our business long-term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Anna Bryson","x":"On the expense side, we will continue to invest in AI and expect costs related to developing and powering our AI solutions to increase in the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2025-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anna Bryson","x":"Our increased outlook is due primarily to the outperformance of our pharma business during the upsell season.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/doximity-docs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Perry Gold","x":"I mean, we've been having that conversation internally and externally for a little while now about DTC, and is it gonna benefit us?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Tangney","x":"Turning to our profitability, Non-GAAP gross margin in the third quarter was 91%, versus 93% in the prior year period, driven by a step up in our AI infrastructure investments from increased usage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Tangney","x":"This is the result of lower Q4 revenue expectations and higher AI infrastructure investment driven by a strong increase in usage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Tangney","x":"Focused on tariffs and pricing, between late December and early January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Perry Gold","x":"…end of the year, when usually we will have signed a large portion of bookings for the next year, and you have many of these top 20 pharma companies that still haven't signed off on these big deals with the White House, these MFN deals, which are pretty broad-based, to do with pricing and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Cherny","x":"…behind me, but diving back in on the demand curve and the booking side, clearly, the narrative on your stock as well as virtually anything else that touches tech and software in the market is on this dynamic AI disruption, whether that's similar look-alike peers, broader GenAI oriented players.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q3","e":"docs","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Glenn Santangelo","x":"You know, Jeff, at this point, it's pretty clear that the public markets, they've been very punishing to companies with this perceived AI disruption and whether it's reality or not, you know, we'll ultimately see.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/doximity-docs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2026-05-13","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey A. Tangney","x":"And, again, that is where we see a high percentage of the spend going toward health care professionals as opposed to DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/doximity-docs-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2026-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Perry Scott Gold","x":"Driven by AI compute costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/doximity-docs-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2026 Q4","e":"docs","d":"2026-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Perry Scott Gold","x":"The primary driver for the change in EBITDA margin versus last year is our increased investment in AI compute, driven by a steep ramp in AI usage, which is outgrowing overall workflow engagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/13/doximity-docs-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q1","e":"docs","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Tangney","x":"I mean it's a very big number, but that does include direct-to-consumer and some other categories that we probably won't play in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/doximity-docs-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q1","e":"docs","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Sonefeldt","x":"Higher-than-expected AI usage creates a good problem for Doximity, and we'll expand our AI investment in fiscal '27 to capture the significant long-term opportunity ahead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/doximity-docs-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q1","e":"docs","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Sonefeldt","x":"We increased AI compute spend during the quarter to support higher-than-expected clinician AI usage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/doximity-docs-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q1","e":"docs","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Tangney","x":"Within hospitals, it's actually sometimes a cost savings because they have been spending a lot of money on clinical decision support and on scribe services from other vendors and we're coming in with an offering that's lower cost than what they may have been using historically.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/doximity-docs-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q1","e":"docs","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Peterson","x":"And I noticed you guys did raise the outlook by a bit more than the beat this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/doximity-docs-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey A. Tangney","x":"Even with over 6x growth year-on-year in our AI spend, our Q2 adjusted EBITDA margin was 51%, or $89 million and 9 percentage points above the high end of our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey A. Tangney","x":"So while this remains our AI investment year, we continue to have strong margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey A. Tangney","x":"And you think about where we were a year ago compared to today, again, there were a lot of negotiations around price and tariffs and there is just a lot of lot of things in the mix that I think we look at this year as a more stable environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthew Sonefeldt","x":"For FY 2027, we are increasing the guidance midpoint by $4.5 million This reflects the flow through of our Q2 outperformance plus a modest incremental raise driven by growing visibility into the commercial AI pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Matthew Sonefeldt","x":"In the second half of FY 27, we will continue to invest in growing clinician AI usage and expanding our moats.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DOCS 2027 Q2","e":"docs","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Daniels","x":"With 16 of the Top 20 pharma clients buying AI search solutions, Are you able to tell us that is at all cannibalizing any of your other sales with them?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/doximity-docs-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,0,0,0,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"cinema":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,0,0,0,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"imax":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,0,0,0,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"streaming":[[49,1,8213,4,3,1,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,3,0,3,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,1,0,1,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"dtc":[[49,1,8213,4,3,1,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,5,0,3,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,1,1,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,1,0,1,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,1,0,1,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"ai_spend":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,3,3,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,5,3,2,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,14,5,7,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,14,6,8,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,12,10,2,7774,1821]],"tariffs":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,2,2,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,0,0,0,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,1,1,0,7774,1821]],"pricing_power":[[49,1,8213,0,0,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,0,0,0,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"cost_cuts":[[49,1,8213,1,1,0,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,0,0,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[65,1,10450,0,0,0,3803,4795],[66,1,9351,1,0,1,3648,5320],[67,1,10197,0,0,0,7774,1821]],"guidance":[[49,1,8213,2,1,1,6394,1409],[63,1,9189,1,1,0,6609,1640],[64,1,9767,0,0,0,7134,1849],[6